 "notes": "Exact algorithm (fitted, 0-level error on the refs): evaluated at the integer pixel position (no +0.5); w_i = 1/(|p-Point_i|^2 + Blend^2); gradient = sum(w_i*Colour8_i)/sum(w_i), floored to 8 bits (G8); mode None: A = floor(srcA8*Opacity/100), premultiplied RGB = (G8*A+127) div 255. Point defaults (10%/90% of the layer) are the values AE gives a 640x360 layer. Not measured against AE: Jitter (proprietary noise; reproduced as a per-pixel dither of +-Jitter/200 of an 8-bit level before the floor), Blending Modes 2..22 (gradient blended over the straight original with the usual formulas, mixed by Opacity, layer alpha kept; modes 19..22 assumed to be Stencil Alpha, Silhouette Alpha, Alpha Add, Luminescent Premul). Colours are rounded to 8 bits before mixing. Groups 1 and 10 and Compositing Options (15) carry no pixel parameter.",
